invariant: INV-10
file: record.c
catches: unit
reason: dropping the send-side wrap guard lets the sequence counter roll over
  from UINT64_MAX to 0, so the same (key, nonce) pair protects two records

--- old
    if (d->seq == UINT64_MAX) {
        return -1; // RFC 9846 §5.5: stop before the next increment could wrap
    }
    size_t body = n + 1 + AEAD_TAG; // inner type byte + tag
--- new
    size_t body = n + 1 + AEAD_TAG; // inner type byte + tag
